   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Advice and obligation",
     "texto": [
      "**Bør + infinitivo** gives advice: **Du bør følge rådet** («You should follow the advice»). **Må + infinitivo** expresses a clearer obligation: **Du må bestille time** («You have to book an appointment»). After both modal verbs **å** is not used."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Information about medicines",
     "texto": [
      "**Pakningsvedlegg** is the leaflet; **bivirkning**, a side effect (an unwanted effect). If you don't understand the instructions, you can ask for them to be explained. This lesson teaches phrases for asking; the specific instructions depend on the doctor or the leaflet."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
